  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n**Given:** 5 (7 S 3) D 3 (8 P 6) V 7 D 11 (3 S 13 S 2) P 2 (41 S 9)\n\nThe codes are as follows:\n\n \n \n\n \n \n**Letters**\n\n \n \n \nP\n\n \n \n \nD\n\n \n \n \nS\n\n \n \n \nV\n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n**Meaning**\n\n \n \n \n+\n\n \n \n \n-\n\n \n \n \n×\n\n \n \n \n÷\n\n \n \n \n\n5 __**(7 **____**×**____** 3)**__ - 3 __**(8 + 6)**__ ÷ 7 - 11 __**(3 **____**× 13 ×**____** 2)**__ + 2 __**(41 **____**× 9)**__\n\n= 5 × 21 - 3 × __**14 **____**÷ 7**__ - 11 × 78 + 2 × 369\n\n= __**5 × 21**__ - __**3 × 2**__ - __**11 **____**× 78**__ + __**2 × 369**__\n\n= __**105**__ - 6 - 858 __**+ 738**__\n\n= 843 - __**6 - 858**__\n\n= **__843 - 864__**\n\n= - 21\n\nHence, '**- 21**' is the correct answer.",
